# Build output
/target

# Tauri-generated files (created by the CLI). The schemas are regenerated on
# every build. The native mobile projects under gen/apple and gen/android are
# generated by `cargo tauri ios init` / `android init`; keep them ignored until
# you customize signing / manifests, then commit those directories deliberately.
/gen/schemas
/gen/apple
/gen/android

# NOTE: /icons is deliberately NOT ignored. Although `cargo tauri icon` produces
# it, `tauri::generate_context!` reads the icons at compile time, so a checkout
# without them (CI) fails to build. They are committed as source assets.
